.TH "GRGSM_LIVEMON" 1 "2017-08-21" "0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grgsm_livemon \- GSM C0 monitor forwarding packages to network interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
grgsm_livemon [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
Interactive monitor of a single C0 channel with analysis performed by
Wireshark.  Example command to run wireshark:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
sudo wireshark \-k \-f udp \-Y gsmtap \-i lo
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH OPTIONS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B  \-h\fP,\fB  \-\-help
show this help message and exit
.TP
.BI \-\-args\fB= ARGS
Set Device Arguments [default=]
.TP
.BI \-g \ GAIN\fR,\fB \ \-\-gain\fB= GAIN
Set gain [default=30]
.TP
.BI \-\-osr\fB= OSR
Set OverSampling Ratio [default=4]
.TP
.BI \-p \ PPM\fR,\fB \ \-\-ppm\fB= PPM
Set ppm [default=0]
.TP
.BI \-s \ SAMP_RATE\fR,\fB \ \-\-samp\-rate\fB= SAMP_RATE
Set samp_rate [default=2M]
.TP
.BI \-o \ SHIFTOFF\fR,\fB \ \-\-shiftoff\fB= SHIFTOFF
Set Frequency Shiftoff [default=400k]
.TP
.BI \-f \ FC\fR,\fB \ \-\-fc\fB= FC
Set GSM channel\(aqs central frequency [default=941.8M]
.UNINDENT
.SH SEE ALSO
